    {
      "id": 1,
      "primary_message": "Combine sherry, sugar and orange slices in a cocktail shaker (if using sugar, stir to dissolve before proceeding). Fill shaker with ice, and shake well. Strain into a highball glass filled with fresh ice. (You may wish to double-strain through a tea strainer if you’re averse to orange pulp in your drink.) Garnish with a slice of orange and fresh blackberries, raspberries or what have you. Poke it with a straw and take it easy.",
